      "end": 87,
      "sha256": "44a04853d057b37f77fbbd76758aa140c3ac13a035bb5cafa9825aaf1fd28b64",
      "text": "  // ---- Browse history (last 10) ----\n  async getHistory(context: common.UIAbilityContext): Promise<number[]> {\n    return this.readNumberArray(context, KEY_HISTORY);\n  }\n\n  async recordHistory(context: common.UIAbilityContext, id: number): Promise<void> {\n    let list = await this.readNumberArray(context, KEY_HISTORY);\n    const idx = list.indexOf(id);\n    if (idx >= 0) {\n      list.splice(idx, 1);\n    }\n    list.unshift(id);\n    if (list.length > 10) {\n      list = list.slice(0, 10);\n    }\n    await this.writeNumberArray(context, KEY_HISTORY, list);\n  }\n\n  // ---- Generic array storage (JSON string) ----\n  private async readNumberArray(context: common.UIAbilityContext, key: string): Promise<number[]> {\n    const pref = this.getPref(context);\n    const raw = pref.getSync(key, '') as string;\n    if (!raw) {\n      return [];\n    }\n    try {\n      const arr: number[] = JSON.parse(raw);\n      return Array.isArray(arr) ? arr : [];\n    } catch (e) {\n      return [];\n    }\n  }\n\n  private async writeNumberArray(context: common.UIAbilityContext, key: string, arr: number[]): Promise<void> {\n    const pref = this.getPref(context);\n    await pref.put(key, JSON.stringify(arr));\n    await pref.flush();"
    },
    {
      "path": "background/self-reported-acceptance.md",
      "start": 23,
      "end": 28,
      "sha256": "9e8328663b7933f0503c4c02390e2ee8af73408c1b37f2f03bb1097df82983ad",
      "text": "## 二、测试与验收结果（模拟器实测）\n\n### 逐项验证记录\n\n1. **首页**（`dump_home.txt` / `shot_home.jpeg`、`dump_homefix.txt` / `shot_homefix.jpeg`）：6 商品卡片（emoji 图 + 名称 + 花语 + 价格 + accessibilityText）、功能入口行（扫一扫/语音搜索/定位/地图/我的）、标题栏定位状态位；**附近门店区**（3 家门店，点击跳门店地图）固定显示于商品列表上方，首屏可见可达。\n2. **浏览历史持久化**（`dump_homescroll.txt`、`dump_relaunch_home.txt`）：浏览商品后 force-stop 重启，首页仍渲染「最近浏览」区 — Preferences `browse_history` 生效。"
    }
